  "an1.394:0.1": "",
  "an1.394:0.2": "18. Aparaaccharāsaṅghātavaggo ",
  "an1.394:1.0": "382. ",
  "an1.394:1.1": "‘‘Accharāsaṅghātamattampi ce, bhikkhave, bhikkhu paṭhamaṃ jhānaṃ bhāveti, ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave – ",
  "an1.394:1.2": "‘bhikkhu arittajjhāno viharati, satthusāsanakaro ovādapatikaro, amoghaṃ raṭṭhapiṇḍaṃ bhuñjati’. ",
  "an1.394:1.3": "Ko pana vādo ye naṃ bahulīkarontī’’ti! ",
  "an1.395:1.0": "383-389. ",
  "an1.395:1.1": "‘‘Accharāsaṅghātamattampi ce, bhikkhave, bhikkhu dutiyaṃ jhānaṃ bhāveti…pe… ",
  "an1.396:1.1": "tatiyaṃ jhānaṃ bhāveti…pe… ",
  "an1.397:1.1": "catutthaṃ jhānaṃ bhāveti…pe… ",
  "an1.398:1.1": "mettaṃ cetovimuttiṃ bhāveti…pe… ",
  "an1.399:1.1": "karuṇaṃ cetovimuttiṃ bhāveti…pe… ",
  "an1.400:1.1": "muditaṃ cetovimuttiṃ bhāveti…pe… ",
  "an1.401:1.1": "upekkhaṃ cetovimuttiṃ bhāveti…pe…. ",
  "an1.402:1.0": "390-393. ",
  "an1.402:1.1": "Kāye kāyānupassī viharati ātāpī sampajāno satimā vineyya loke abhijjhādomanassaṃ; ",
  "an1.403:1.1": "vedanāsu vedanānupassī viharati…pe… ",
  "an1.404:1.1": "citte cittānupassī viharati…pe… ",
  "an1.405:1.1": "dhammesu dhammānupassī viharati ātāpī sampajāno satimā vineyya loke abhijjhādomanassaṃ. ",
  "an1.406:1.0": "394-397. ",
  "an1.406:1.1": "Anuppannānaṃ pāpakānaṃ akusalānaṃ dhammānaṃ anuppādāya chandaṃ janeti vāyamati vīriyaṃ ārabhati cittaṃ paggaṇhāti padahati; ",
  "an1.407:1.1": "uppannānaṃ pāpakānaṃ akusalānaṃ dhammānaṃ pahānāya chandaṃ janeti vāyamati vīriyaṃ ārabhati cittaṃ paggaṇhāti padahati. ",
  "an1.408:1.1": "Anuppannānaṃ kusalānaṃ dhammānaṃ uppādāya chandaṃ janeti vāyamati vīriyaṃ ārabhati cittaṃ paggaṇhāti padahati; ",
  "an1.409:1.1": "uppannānaṃ kusalānaṃ dhammānaṃ ṭhitiyā asammosāya bhiyyobhāvāya vepullāya bhāvanāya pāripūriyā chandaṃ janeti vāyamati vīriyaṃ ārabhati cittaṃ paggaṇhāti padahati. ",
  "an1.410:1.0": "398-401. ",
