  "an1.439:1.0": "427-434. ",
  "an1.439:1.1": "Ajjhattaṃ rūpasaññī bahiddhā rūpāni passati parittāni suvaṇṇadubbaṇṇāni. ",
  "an1.439:1.2": "‘Tāni abhibhuyya ",
  "an1.439:1.3": "jānāmi passāmī’ti – ",
  "an1.439:1.4": "evaṃsaññī hoti… ",
  "an1.440:1.1": "ajjhattaṃ rūpasaññī bahiddhā rūpāni passati appamāṇāni suvaṇṇadubbaṇṇāni. ",
  "an1.440:1.2": "‘Tāni abhibhuyya ",
  "an1.440:1.3": "jānāmi passāmī’ti – ",
  "an1.440:1.4": "evaṃsaññī hoti… ",
  "an1.441:1.1": "ajjhattaṃ arūpasaññī bahiddhā rūpāni passati parittāni suvaṇṇadubbaṇṇāni. ",
  "an1.441:1.2": "‘Tāni abhibhuyya ",
  "an1.441:1.3": "jānāmi passāmī’ti – ",
  "an1.441:1.4": "evaṃsaññī hoti… ",
  "an1.442:1.1": "ajjhattaṃ arūpasaññī bahiddhā rūpāni passati appamāṇāni suvaṇṇadubbaṇṇāni. ",
  "an1.442:1.2": "‘Tāni abhibhuyya ",
  "an1.442:1.3": "jānāmi passāmī’ti – ",
  "an1.442:1.4": "evaṃsaññī hoti… ",
  "an1.443:1.1": "ajjhattaṃ arūpasaññī bahiddhā rūpāni passati nīlāni nīlavaṇṇāni nīlanidassanāni nīlanibhāsāni. ",
  "an1.443:1.2": "‘Tāni abhibhuyya ",
  "an1.443:1.3": "jānāmi passāmī’ti – ",
  "an1.443:1.4": "evaṃsaññī hoti… ",
  "an1.444:1.1": "ajjhattaṃ arūpasaññī bahiddhā rūpāni passati pītāni pītavaṇṇāni pītanidassanāni pītanibhāsāni. ",
  "an1.444:1.2": "‘Tāni abhibhuyya ",
  "an1.444:1.3": "jānāmi passāmī’ti – ",
  "an1.444:1.4": "evaṃsaññī hoti… ",
  "an1.445:1.1": "ajjhattaṃ arūpasaññī bahiddhā rūpāni passati lohitakāni lohitakavaṇṇāni lohitakanidassanāni lohitakanibhāsāni. ",
  "an1.445:1.2": "‘Tāni abhibhuyya ",
  "an1.445:1.3": "jānāmi passāmī’ti ",
  "an1.445:1.4": "evaṃsaññī hoti… ",
  "an1.446:1.1": "ajjhattaṃ arūpasaññī bahiddhā rūpāni passati odātāni odātavaṇṇāni odātanidassanāni odātanibhāsāni. ",
  "an1.446:1.2": "‘Tāni abhibhuyya ",
  "an1.446:1.3": "jānāmi passāmī’ti – ",
  "an1.446:1.4": "evaṃsaññī hoti…. ",
  "an1.447:1.0": "435-442. ",
  "an1.447:1.1": "Rūpī rūpāni passati… ",
  "an1.448:1.1": "ajjhattaṃ arūpasaññī bahiddhā rūpāni passati ",
  "an1.449:1.1": "subhanteva adhimutto hoti… ",
  "an1.450:1.1": "sabbaso rūpasaññānaṃ samatikkamā paṭighasaññānaṃ atthaṅgamā nānattasaññānaṃ amanasikārā ananto ākāsoti ākāsānañcāyatanaṃ upasampajja viharati… ",
  "an1.451:1.1": "sabbaso ākāsānañcāyatanaṃ samatikkamma anantaṃ viññāṇanti viññāṇañcāyatanaṃ upasampajja viharati… ",
  "an1.452:1.1": "sabbaso viññāṇañcāyatanaṃ samatikkamma natthi kiñcīti ākiñcaññāyatanaṃ upasampajja viharati… ",
  "an1.453:1.1": "sabbaso ākiñcaññāyatanaṃ samatikkamma nevasaññānāsaññāyatanaṃ upasampajja viharati… ",
  "an1.454:1.1": "sabbaso nevasaññānāsaññāyatanaṃ samatikkamma saññāvedayitanirodhaṃ upasampajja viharati…. ",
